pening theme with lyrics by Yoshikazu Kuwashima, known for his work on vocal tracks for the &quot;Grisaia&quot; series.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1920x1080 resolution support.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104270/extras/889b58ec015f2b59c6fb13754b4252d0.poster.avif?t=1770885142\" width=1170 height=671 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104270/extras/889b58ec015f2b59c6fb13754b4252d0.webm?t=1770885142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main Character</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kanade (VA: Yuko Natsuyoshi)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A half-human, half-alien girl who loves to sing. She hopes to save the world through song in place of her alien mother, who isn't there to do it anymore. Honest, kind-hearted, and always polite, she puts her all into everything she does. However, her unfamiliarity with Earth as a half-alien sometimes shows itself in ways that surprise those around her.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the near future, a sudden proliferation of plants has left much of human civilization drowning in greenery. Yuuto is a boy living in a city that's now largely reclaimed by nature. One day, a girl named Kanade appears on his doorstep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The two had been exchanging letters after she found one of his carrier pigeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;I have to sing the greatest love song and save the world in my mother's place.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>So, Yuuto-san... Would you please fall in love with me?&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warmly watched over by those around them, the two tentatively begin their exploration of love. What neither of them realize is that a spark of affection has already budded between them...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fall in love, make music, and save the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the tale of a wondrous future where the encounter between a boy and girl brings a miracle to the world.</p>","developers":["Frontwing"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104270/header.jpg?t=1770885142","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9Frontwing / GOOD SMILE COMPANY","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3104270/1120735500/3f30fb9824e28ed2b6c86ce9c6e1eed6e1a73037/1750823672/dash_av1.mpd?t=1748509457","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3104270/1120735500/3f30fb9824e28ed2b6c86ce9c6e1eed6e1a73037/1750823672/dash_h264.mpd?t=1748509457","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3104270/1120735500/3f30fb9824e28ed2b6c86ce9c6e1eed6e1a73037/1750823672/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1748509457","id":257147504,"name":"KANADE Opening Movie","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257147504/22e31a7dab80de75f5d39f97dda6b973cafc9a65/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748509457"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3104270/843916/3c06e1323175335864a288ae4e56e60ccd97ec28/1750823663/dash_av1.mpd?t=1742523961","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3104270/843916/3c06e1323175335864a288ae4e56e60ccd97ec28/1750823663/dash_h264.mpd?t=1742523961","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3104270/843916/3c06e1323175335864a288ae4e56e60ccd97ec28/1750823663/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1742523961","id":257109560,"name":"KANADE Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/ap